cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "ASP.NET Core Security Misconfiguration Benchmark"
abstract: >-
  Pairs of minimal ASP.NET Core apps, one vulnerable and one fixed, for security
  misconfigurations where a protection silently does not apply, with a runner that
  verifies the behavior on .NET 8 and .NET 10 and evaluates whether static analysis
  tools detect each misconfiguration.
